But R.S., S.A. and B.S. khatians wrongly stood recorded in the 
names of Ramesh and Nillamber. It is also claimed that Ramesh 
Chandra was eldest brother of Purna Chandra and Korta of a joint 
family, as per Hindu Law any property acquired by Korta of a 
