Act, 1947 for 5(five) years imprisonment and with fine of Tk. 1.50 
crore. The learned Advocate also raised doubt about the 
genuineness of the affidavit sworn in the instant writ petition. The 
learned Advocate next submits that by suppressing all these facts 
