Constitution, read with Sections 6 and 8 of the S¡a£u pwp-cl ¢ehÑ¡Q¢e 
Hm¡L¡l p£j¡e¡ ¢edÑ¡lZ BCe 2021. While performing functions of 
delimitation, the Election Commission relies upon the latest census 
report and also takes into consideration certain aspects, such as 
