accused demanded dowry of Tk. 5,00,000, and when she refused to 
pay the dowry, the accused beat her, and P.W. 5 Doctor Golam 
Mostafa proved the medical certificate of the victim P.W. 1 Zinia 
Farzana Sonia as exhibit 2. P.Ws 2 to 4 and P.W. 6 also corroborated 
the evidence of P.W. 1 victim Zinia Farzana Sonia. The prosecution 
proved the charge against the accused beyond all reasonable doubt, 
and the trial Court, considering the evidence of both parties, legally 
