At the instance of the plaintiff in Title Suit No. 514 of 2021, this 
Rule was issued calling upon opposite party no. 1 to show cause as to 
why the judgment and order dated 26.10.2023 passed by the learned 
Additional District Judge, 8th Court, Dhaka in Miscellaneous Appeal No. 
178 of 2023 dismissing the appeal and affirming the judgment and order 
dated 13.06.2023  passed by the learned Senior Assistant Judge, 2nd 
