passed by the learned Metropolitan Session Judge, Dhaka in 
Metro Sessions Case No.6171 of 2014 against accused Rasel under 
Section 15(2) of the ¢ekÑ¡ae Hhw ®qg¡S−a jªa¥É (¢eh¡lZ) BCe, 
